                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "p8-q17-d-short-method",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Arrange the consonants, then place the vowels in different gaps.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "Arrange M, D, L and S in $4!$ ways. There are five gaps around them. Place O, U and E in distinct gaps, giving 5, 4 and 3 choices respectively.\n$$\\begin{align*}N&=4!\\times5\\times4\\times3\\\\N&=1440\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
